= The General Strike

The Miner's Federations have launched a nation wide strike due to plans to lower miner's wages. The strike is quickly escalting and could shut down all British industry. It's also no secret of the Communist sympathies within the strikers.


- @cap: We can't let people with Communist sympathies grow so powerful...
- @do_something: The miners have a point...

@cap

The revolutionary sympathies of the strikers are deeply concerning. We can't allow the nation to be controlled by Socialists.

@do_something
on-arrival: crisis_urgency += 1

The right wing base is horrifed by our cautious support for the strike. However, Our more radical members and miner strikers cheer our stance.
